#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:7
msgid "Curriculum tutoring for secondary school"
msgstr "Ufundishaji wa mtaala kwa shule ya sekondari"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:8
msgid ""
"A tutor that works through your school curriculum one lesson at a time, "
"checks what was learned, and reports it to the teacher. Runs without an "
"internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Mkufunzi anayepitia mtaala wa shule yako somo moja kwa wakati, hukagua "
"kilichojifunzwa, na kumripoti mwalimu. Hufanya kazi bila muunganisho wa "
"intaneti."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:30
msgid "Skip to sign in"
msgstr "Rukia kuingia"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:45
msgid "Secondary school"
msgstr "Shule ya sekondari"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:47
msgid "AI Powered Tutor"
msgstr "Mkufunzi Anayetumia AI"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:50
msgid ""
"Students learn by talking through a lesson, not by watching one. The tutor "
"asks, listens, and only moves on when the answer shows understanding — then "
"tells the teacher what it saw."
msgstr ""
"Wanafunzi hujifunza kwa kuzungumza somo, si kwa kulitazama. Mkufunzi "
"huuliza, husikiliza, na huendelea tu wakati jibu linapoonyesha uelewa — "
"kisha humwambia mwalimu kile alichokiona."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:54
#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/classes/detail.html:145
#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/flagged_sessions.html:56
#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/lesson_monitor.html:254
#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/lesson_session_report.html:389
#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/reports/overview.html:62
#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/students/list.html:32
#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/summative/review.html:122
msgid "Student"
msgstr "Mwanafunzi"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:55
#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/base.html:98
msgid "Teacher/Admin"
msgstr "Mwalimu au Msimamizi"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:59
msgid "New here? You can create an account on either sign-in page."
msgstr ""
"Ni mgeni hapa? Unaweza kufungua akaunti kwenye ukurasa wowote wa kuingia."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:70
msgid "How one lesson goes"
msgstr "Jinsi somo moja linavyokwenda"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:75
#: ai_tutor/templates/tutoring/catalog.html:158
msgid "Engage"
msgstr "Shirikisha"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:76
msgid "Opens with a question about something the student already knows."
msgstr "Huanza na swali kuhusu kitu ambacho mwanafunzi tayari anakijua."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:82
#: ai_tutor/templates/tutoring/catalog.html:159
msgid "Explore"
msgstr "Chunguza"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:83
msgid "The student works the idea out loud; the tutor asks rather than tells."
msgstr ""
"Mwanafunzi hufanyia kazi wazo kwa sauti; mkufunzi huuliza badala ya kueleza."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:89
#: ai_tutor/templates/tutoring/catalog.html:160
msgid "Explain"
msgstr "Eleza"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:90
msgid "The idea gets named and tied to the curriculum's own wording."
msgstr "Wazo hupewa jina na kuunganishwa na maneno ya mtaala wenyewe."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:96
msgid "Elaborate"
msgstr "Fafanua"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:97
msgid "A harder case, to see whether it holds outside the first example."
msgstr "Mfano mgumu zaidi, kuona kama unashikilia nje ya mfano wa kwanza."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:103
msgid "Exit ticket"
msgstr "Tiketi ya kutoka"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:104
msgid "A short check. The score is what the teacher sees the next morning."
msgstr "Ukaguzi mfupi. Alama ndiyo mwalimu anayoiona asubuhi inayofuata."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:116
msgid "It teaches the syllabus the school already uses"
msgstr "Hufundisha muhtasari ambao shule tayari inautumia"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:117
msgid ""
"A teacher uploads the curriculum — schemes of work, past papers, worksheets. "
"The platform turns it into lessons and keeps every answer grounded in that "
"material, so a student is not being taught a different course from the one "
"they sit an exam in."
msgstr ""
"Mwalimu hupakia mtaala — mipango ya kazi, mitihani ya zamani, karatasi za "
"kazi. Jukwaa hulibadilisha kuwa masomo na hushikilia kila jibu kwenye nyenzo "
"hiyo, ili mwanafunzi asifundishwe kozi tofauti na ile atakayofanyia mtihani."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:123
msgid "Talks, doesn't lecture"
msgstr "Huzungumza, haitoi mhadhara"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:124
msgid ""
"Every step is a question. A student who answers correctly moves on; a "
"student who doesn't gets a smaller step, not the answer."
msgstr ""
"Kila hatua ni swali. Mwanafunzi anayejibu kwa usahihi huendelea; asiyejibu "
"hupewa hatua ndogo zaidi, si jibu."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:129
msgid "Measures what stuck"
msgstr "Hupima kilichobaki"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:130
msgid ""
"Each lesson ends with an exit ticket. Scores are per objective, so a teacher "
"sees which idea a class missed, not just who scored low."
msgstr ""
"Kila somo huisha na tiketi ya kutoka. Alama ni kwa kila lengo, hivyo mwalimu "
"huona wazo gani darasa lilikosa, si tu nani alipata alama za chini."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:135
msgid "Watched, not unattended"
msgstr "Inatazamwa, haijaachwa"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:136
msgid ""
"Conversations are checked for harmful, inappropriate and manipulative "
"content. Anything flagged goes to a named teacher to review."
msgstr ""
"Mazungumzo hukaguliwa kuona maudhui yenye madhara, yasiyofaa na ya "
"udanganyifu. Chochote kinachoripotiwa huenda kwa mwalimu aliyetajwa kukagua."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:141
msgid "One device, two students"
msgstr "Kifaa kimoja, wanafunzi wawili"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:142
msgid ""
"Where devices are shared, a teacher can pair students into groups and the "
"tutor runs the lesson for the pair."
msgstr ""
"Pale vifaa vinaposhirikiwa, mwalimu anaweza kuunganisha wanafunzi katika "
"vikundi na mkufunzi huendesha somo kwa jozi."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:147
msgid "Reports for the teacher"
msgstr "Ripoti kwa mwalimu"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:148
msgid ""
"A dashboard shows who has been active, how the class scored, and which "
"students went backwards on a retry."
msgstr ""
"Dashibodi huonyesha nani amekuwa akitumia, darasa lilipata alama gani, na "
"wanafunzi gani walirudi nyuma walipojaribu tena."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:153
msgid "In the classroom's language"
msgstr "Kwa lugha ya darasani"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:154
msgid ""
"The interface and the lessons follow the language the course is taught in, "
"set per school."
msgstr ""
"Kiolesura na masomo hufuata lugha ambayo kozi inafundishwa, iliyowekwa kwa "
"kila shule."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:170
msgid "Run it on your own hardware"
msgstr "Iendeshe kwenye vifaa vyako mwenyewe"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:171
msgid ""
"Neither option needs a connection to us. Pick the one that matches who is "
"running it — a teacher in one classroom, or a ministry across a district."
msgstr ""
"Chaguo lolote halihitaji muunganisho nasi. Chagua linalolingana na "
"anayeiendesha — mwalimu katika darasa moja, au wizara katika wilaya."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:177
msgid "No internet? It still teaches."
msgstr "Hakuna intaneti? Bado hufundisha."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:178
msgid ""
"The desktop build runs the whole platform — tutor, curriculum and marking — "
"on one machine in the classroom, serving students over its own WiFi. Nothing "
"leaves the room, and nothing needs a connection."
msgstr ""
"Toleo la kompyuta huendesha jukwaa zima — mkufunzi, mtaala na usahihishaji — "
"kwenye mashine moja darasani, likihudumia wanafunzi kupitia WiFi yake. "
"Hakuna kinachotoka chumbani, na hakuna kinachohitaji muunganisho."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:179
msgid "Get the offline app"
msgstr "Pata programu ya bila mtandao"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:184
msgid "Host it on your own servers"
msgstr "Ipangishe kwenye seva zako mwenyewe"

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/landing.html:185
msgid ""
"For a school group or a ministry that needs the data to stay on "
"infrastructure it controls. The whole platform is deployable from source, "
"with your own models and your own storage."
msgstr ""
"Kwa kundi la shule au wizara inayohitaji data ibaki kwenye miundombinu "
"inayoidhibiti. Jukwaa zima linaweza kusambazwa kutoka chanzo, kwa modeli "
"zako mwenyewe na hifadhi yako mwenyewe."

