"Which offline tutor to use. Larger ones understand more but answer more "
"slowly."
msgstr ""
"Mkufunzi gani wa bila mtandao wa kutumia. Wakubwa huelewa zaidi lakini "
"hujibu polepole."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/settings.html:264
msgid "Internet tutor: available right now."
msgstr "Mkufunzi wa intaneti: anapatikana sasa hivi."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/settings.html:266
