"Internet tutor: not reachable right now — lessons will use the offline tutor."
msgstr ""
"Mkufunzi wa intaneti: hapatikani sasa hivi — masomo yatatumia mkufunzi wa "
"bila mtandao."

#: ai_tutor/templates/accounts/settings.html:270
