msgstr "HAIWEZI"

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:678
msgid ""
"When unchecked, the chat-page picker is hidden and every session uses the "
"default duration."
msgstr ""
"Isipochaguliwa, kichagua cha ukurasa wa mazungumzo hufichwa na kila kipindi "
"hutumia muda wa chaguo-msingi."

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:699
msgid "Catch up on pending work"
msgstr "Maliza kazi zinazosubiri"

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:700
msgid ""
"Sweep the course for two common gaps: images that never rendered, and "
"lesson / exit-ticket content that hasn't been audited by the AI judges yet. "
"Both run in the background and are idempotent — already-done items are "
"skipped. You can pick a specific provider/model per run (task #216)."
msgstr ""
"Pitia kozi kutafuta mapengo mawili ya kawaida: picha ambazo hazikuonyeshwa "
"kamwe, na maudhui ya somo au tiketi ya kutoka ambayo bado hayajakaguliwa na "
"wahakiki wa AI. Vyote hukimbia nyuma ya pazia na havirudii — vipengele "
"vilivyokamilika hurukwa. Unaweza kuchagua mtoa huduma au modeli mahususi kwa "
"kila mzunguko (kazi #216)."

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:715
msgid "Force a specific image provider for this run"
msgstr "Lazimisha mtoa huduma maalum wa picha kwa mzunguko huu"

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:717
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Chaguo-msingi"

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:722
msgid ""
"When checked: re-generate every image, overwriting existing URLs. Otherwise: "
"only fill in images whose URL is empty."
msgstr ""
"Ukichagua: zalisha upya kila picha, ukiandika juu ya URL zilizopo. "
"Vinginevyo: jaza tu picha zenye URL tupu."

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:728
msgid ""
"Generate any image whose URL is empty. With Re-do already-done checked: "
"regenerate every image."
msgstr ""
"Zalisha picha yoyote yenye URL tupu. Ukichagua Rudia zilizokamilika: zalisha "
"upya kila picha."

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:744
msgid ""
"Force a specific judge model for this run (default = use configured chain)"
msgstr ""
"Lazimisha modeli mahususi ya mhakiki kwa mzunguko huu (chaguo-msingi = tumia "
"mnyororo uliosanidiwa)"

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:746
msgid "Default (configured chain)"
msgstr "Chaguo-msingi (mnyororo uliosanidiwa)"

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:755
msgid ""
"When checked: re-judge every step + exit-Q, overwriting existing verdicts. "
"Otherwise: only judge content whose judge_outputs is empty."
msgstr ""
"Ukichagua: hakiki upya kila hatua na swali la kutoka, ukiandika juu ya "
"maamuzi yaliyopo. Vinginevyo: hakiki tu maudhui yenye judge_outputs tupu."

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:761
msgid ""
"Run content judges (factual, pedagogy, safety, exit-question). Pending: only "
"unreviewed. With Re-do already-done checked: re-judge everything (overwrite)."
msgstr ""
"Endesha wahakiki wa maudhui (ukweli, ufundishaji, usalama, swali la kutoka). "
"Inayosubiri: ambazo hazijakaguliwa tu. Ukichagua Rudia zilizokamilika: "
"hakiki upya kila kitu (andika juu)."

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:777
msgid "Regenerate content"
msgstr "Zalisha maudhui upya"

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:782
msgid "Wipe + regenerate LessonStep rows. ~2 min/lesson."
msgstr "Futa na uzalishe upya safu za LessonStep. ~dak 2 kwa somo."

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:786
msgid ""
"Replace ExitTicketQuestion rows in place. Attempt history is preserved (FK "
"is to ExitTicket, not the questions). ~30s/lesson."
msgstr ""
"Badilisha safu za ExitTicketQuestion papo hapo. Historia ya majaribio "
"huhifadhiwa (FK ni kwa ExitTicket, si maswali). ~sek 30 kwa somo."

#: ai_tutor/templates/dashboard/curriculum/course_detail.html:791
msgid ""
"Re-sample the summative bank from current exit tickets. No LLM call. Attempt "
"history preserved."
msgstr ""
"Chukua sampuli mpya ya benki ya mtihani wa mwisho kutoka tiketi za sasa za "
"kutoka. Hakuna wito wa LLM. Historia ya majaribio huhifadhiwa."

